    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a> class\nusing a <a href=\"DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a> and <a href=\"../env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用 `<a href=\"DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a>` 和 `<a href=\"../env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a>` 创建一个新的 `<a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a>` 类实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a> class\nusing the given <a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> and <a href=\"../env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的 <a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a> 类实例，使用给定的 <a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"../env/PropertyResolver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>PropertyResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of the <a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a> class\nusing the given <a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "使用给定的<a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a>创建一个新的<a href=\"ResourceEditor.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceEditor</code></a>类实例。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - the <code>ResourceLoader</code> to use",
      "translation": "<code>resourceLoader</code> - 要使用的 <code>ResourceLoader</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>propertyResolver</code> - the <code>PropertyResolver</code> to use",
      "translation": "<code>propertyResolver</code> - 要使用的 <code>PropertyResolver</code>",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "The path may contain <code>${...}</code> placeholders, to be\nresolved as <a href=\"../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> properties:\nfor example, <code>${user.dir}</code>. Unresolvable placeholders are ignored by default.",
      "translation": "路径可以包含 `<code>${...}</code>` 占位符，这些占位符将作为 <a href=\"../env/Environment.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> 属性进行解析：例如，<code>${user.dir}</code>。默认情况下，无法解析的占位符将被忽略。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates to a <a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a> to do the heavy lifting,\nby default using a <a href=\"DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "委托给一个<a href=\"ResourceLoader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>ResourceLoader</code></a>来执行繁重的工作，默认使用一个<a href=\"DefaultResourceLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core.io\"><code>DefaultResourceLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve the given path, replacing placeholders with corresponding\nproperty values from the <code>environment</code> if necessary.",
      "translation": "解析给定的路径，必要时用 `<code>environment` 中的相应属性值替换占位符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders</code> - whether to ignore unresolvable placeholders\nif no corresponding property could be found in the given <code>propertyResolver</code>",
      "translation": "<code>ignoreUnresolvablePlaceholders</code> - 如果无法在指定的 <code>propertyResolver</code> 中找到对应的属性，是否忽略无法解析的占位符。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Juergen Hoeller, Dave Syer, Chris Beams",
      "translation": "Juergen Hoeller, Dave Syer, Chris Beams",
      "count": 2
    },
